# Eiffel: ECMA-367 (Eiffel: Analysis, Design and Programming Language), 8.32 lexical components; requirements/languages/eiffel.md
name     eiffel e
keyword  across agent alias all and as assign attribute check class convert create Current debug deferred
keyword  do else elseif end ensure expanded export external feature from frozen if implies inherit
keyword  inspect invariant like local loop not note obsolete old once only or Precursor redefine rename
keyword  require rescue Result retry select separate then undefine until variant when xor
type     INTEGER REAL DOUBLE BOOLEAN CHARACTER STRING ANY NONE ARRAY LIST
builtin  True False Void print io
fold-case
line-comment   --
string   " "  : escapes
escape        : char=%
operators  +-*/=<>:.~
upper-type
